{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"48":{"eng-name":"The Book of Adornment","ara-name":"كتاب الزينة من السنن"}},"section_detail":{"48":{"hadithnumber_first":5040,"hadithnumber_last":5378,"arabicnumber_first":5040,"arabicnumber_last":5378}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":5247,"arabicnumber":5247,"text":"Rapporté par Mu'awiyah : Ô gens, le Prophète ﷺ vous a interdit de donner de fausses impressions. Il a apporté un morceau de tissu noir et l'a jeté devant eux en disant : \"C'est ce que les femmes mettent sur leur tête pour le couvrir","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih Isnaad"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":48,"hadith":208},"chapter":{"id":68,"ara-name":"باب وَصْلِ الشَّعْرِ بِالْخِرَقِ ","eng-name":"Hair Extensions Made of Cloth","isFirstHadith":true}}]}